  "description": "SIYFIS crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C128 H120 Dy4 N12 O22. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.572-3.838 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.04-112.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C128H120Dy4N12O22.",
